        "detail": "Now, let's uncover the tale behind 'Numb' by Linkin Park. This powerful track was co-written by Mike Shinoda and Chester Bennington, reflecting on the pressures of conformity. Recorded at NRG Recording Studios in North Hollywood, the song's production was a blend of electronic and rock elements, showcasing the band's innovative sound. Fun fact: the iconic chorus was inspired by a poem Chester wrote in high school. So, keep feeling the music with us, and stay tuned for more!"
